  "_about": "Settings for the research digest (/digest/). The site reads the slot labels; scripts/digest/fetch_candidates.py reads everything else. Keyword weights: 3 = central to my work, 2 = close, 1 = useful context. Terms match whole words in titles and abstracts, case-insensitive, with an optional plural s. Each list in a slot's 'require' needs at least one hit; any 'exclude' hit drops the paper from that slot. A slot with a 'retired' date takes no new posts; it stays so older posts keep their label. Slots with 'kind': 'dissection' or 'weekly' are not keyword-scored: the dissection slot ranks papers that have published referee reports (see 'referee_journals'), and the weekly slot runs on Sundays only, in place of every daily slot.",
